---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="页面未找到 — My Skill Library"
  description="你访问的页面不存在，回到作品画廊继续浏览。"
>
  <main id="main-content" class="page-shell detail-page">
    <div class="gallery-placeholder" style="min-height: 54vh">
      <div>
        <span class="section-kicker">404 · LOST IN THE LIBRARY</span>
        <h1 style="margin: 16px 0 8px; font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.5rem); letter-spacing: -0.06em">
          页面未找到
        </h1>
        <p>这页暂时没有被收录。回到作品画廊，看看有没有新的灵感。</p>
        <a class="action-link" style="margin-top: 22px" href="/">
          返回首页 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
